blocks.en:
Figure 3: The three conditioning schemes. The explicit paradigm denoises the future video tokens across the schedule;
the latent paradigm drops them and keeps only the single forward pass.
We propose Simple-WAM, which keeps both the future video tokens and the single forward pass: future video tokens are input as pure Gaussian noise at τ = 1 \tau=1 and are never denoised.

blocks.zh:
图3:三个条件方案。 明晰的范式将未来的视频符号置于整个时间表中;
潜伏的范式让它们消失,只让单一的前进。
我们提议使用Simple-WAM, 它既保留未来的视频标志, 也保存单个前传: 未来的视频标志是作为纯高斯语的噪声输入的,

